#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00003f
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000040
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000041
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000042
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000043
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00003f
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000040
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000041
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000042
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000043
msgid "Meal, Ready-to-Eat. Recovers LIFE. Select from Equipment window and press <I=USE> to use. Automatically used if LIFE reaches zero when equipped."
msgstr "即食口粮。恢复生命值。在装备窗口选择后按<I=USE>使用。装备时生命值归零会自动使用。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000044
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000045
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000044
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000045
msgid "Popular food in Japan. Spicy and delicious. Recovers LIFE. Automatically used if LIFE reaches zero when equipped."
msgstr "日本热门食物。香辣美味。恢复生命值。装备时生命值归零会自动使用。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000046
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000047
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000046
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000047
msgid "Popular food in Japan. Spicy and delicious. Recovers LIFE. Updated with enhanced flavor thanks to the latest in food technology."
msgstr "日本热门食物。香辣美味。恢复生命值。借助最新食品技术，风味更佳。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000048
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000048
msgid "Popular food in Japan. Spicy and delicious. Recovers LIFE. The next generation of food R&D  - truly a taste of the future!"
msgstr "日本热门食物。香辣美味。恢复生命值。新一代食品研发——真正的未来之味！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000049
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004a
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004b
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004c
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004d
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000049
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004a
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004b
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004c
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004d
msgid "Military battery. Recharges all item battery gauges. Currently recharging..."
msgstr "军用电池。为所有道具电池槽充电。正在充电……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004e
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004e
msgid "Recovers PSYCHE with its alluring fragrance while keeping you at the top of your game."
msgstr "以迷人香气恢复精神，同时让你保持最佳状态。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004f
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000050
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000051
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000052
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00004f
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000050
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000051
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000052
msgid "Take your favorite tunes with you wherever you go! Press <I=STA> to access the Controls Menu. (Cannot be used in VERSUS OPS.)"
msgstr "随身携带你喜欢的音乐！按<I=STA>进入控制菜单。（无法在对战任务中使用。）"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000053
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000053
msgid "Huey's letter to Strangelove entrusted to Snake. He made it clear he didn't want it to be read..."
msgstr "休伊托SNAKE转交斯特兰奇洛夫的信。他明确表示不希望这封信被阅读……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000054
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000054
msgid "Jigsaw made of steel wire. Alternate pressing the L and R buttons to use."
msgstr "钢丝拼图。交替按L和R键使用。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000055
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000055
msgid "ID card stolen from Strangelove. Appears to open locks inside the prison, but which ones is unclear."
msgstr "从斯特兰奇洛夫偷来的ID卡。似能开监狱内的锁，但具体哪些不明。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000056
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000056
msgid "ID card received from Huey. Enables access to Strangelove's lab."
msgstr "从休伊处收到的ID卡。可进入斯特兰奇洛夫的实验室。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000057
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000057
msgid "High-quality rangefinder camera. Equip to look through rangefinder, then press <I=ATK> to press shutter button. Photos taken can be viewed from the XMB<I=TM>."
msgstr "高品质测距相机。装备后通过测距仪观察，按<I=ATK>按下快门。拍摄的照片可从XMB<I=TM>查看。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000058
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000058
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. When equipped it will display various information on nearby enemies. Invaluable tool for executing missions."
msgstr "分析敌方信息的装置。装备后会显示附近敌人的各种信息。执行任务的必备工具。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000059
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005a
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000059
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005a
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. Modified to improve search range, speed, and accuracy of analysis."
msgstr "分析敌人信息的装置。经改造提升了搜索范围、速度和分析精度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005b
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005b
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. Modified to improve search range and speed."
msgstr "分析敌人信息的装置。经改造提升了搜索范围和速度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005c
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005c
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies.  Even when unequipped, you can still gather info on enemy machinery and higher-ranking soldiers by pressing <I=STA>."
msgstr "分析敌方信息的装置。即使未装备，按<I=STA>仍可收集敌方机械和高级士兵的信息。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005d
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005e
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005d
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005e
msgid "Special, disposable mat that renders you or a teammate invisible when prone or against a wall. To use on a teammate, press <I=ACT> next to them when the icon is displayed."
msgstr "特殊一次性垫子，趴下或靠墙时可使自己或队友隐形。对队友使用时，在图标显示时于其旁边按<I=ACT>。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005f
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x00005f
msgid "Special camouflage that makes its user invisible when equipped."
msgstr "特殊迷彩，装备后可使使用者隐形。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000060
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000060
msgid "A bigger cardboard box. Might be able to fit two people. Select from the Equipment window and press the L button to \"DROP\" in order to set (for hunter control type, press <I=LEFT>)."
msgstr "更大的纸箱。也许能装下两个人。在装备窗口选择后按L键“放下”来设置（猎人控制模式下按<I=LEFT>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000061
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000062
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000063
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000064
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000061
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000062
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000063
#: stage/174/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000064
msgid "A bigger cardboard box. Might be able to fit two people. Modified to improve durability.  \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "更大的纸箱。也许能装两人。改造后更耐用。“放下”来设置。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_item_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_item_text_en.olang/0x048941/0x000065
